      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Please know, I will watch every single Top Gun movie you make Tom Cruise. \n\nLiterally, every single one. Top Gun 36? Great. Just keep em coming and I and my family will keep going to the theatre to see them. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\n\nVariety (@Variety)\n\n\"Top Gun 3\" is officially in the works at Paramount, with Tom Cruise set to return and Jerry Bruckheimer producing, as announced at #CinemaCon. \n\nvariety.com/2026/film/news/t\u2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/Variety/status/2044829091183173854#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2045642911870603583",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-18T23:17:31+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Take me home, country road\u2026\n\n\nN A T U R E (@Globe32048)\n\nU.S. Route 163 leading into Monument Valley \u2601\ufe0f\ud83c\udf35\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/Globe32048/status/2044876718524281244#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2045593892376969709",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-18T20:02:43+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It's uncomfortable to tell people that I went to an Ivy League school because of what has become of the higher education landscape. But I can tell you that I will NEVER send my kids to one of these schools.\n\nWatch my full conversation with @EliseStefanik! piped.video/BGN9aNagE0I\n\nVideo",
